re (歌手音色)\nSoft, Clear, Warm, Gentle, Smooth, Sweet, Emotional, Mellow, Powerful, Youthful, Bright, Rough, Raspy, Melodic, Deep, Soulful, Strong, Energetic, Breathy, Passionate\n\n6. Topic (主题)\nLove, Relationship, Hope, Longing, Loss, Heartbreak, Memory, Reflection, Life, Faith, Regret, Freedom, Breakup, Nature, Loneliness, Dreams, Nostalgia, Romance, Friendship, Youth\n\n7. Gender (性别)\nMale, Female\n\nOutput Format\n\nOutput ONLY the comma-separated tags.\n\nDo not add explanations.\n\nAim for a mix of Genre, Instrument, and Mood at minimum.\n\nExample Output: pop,piano,emotional,love,soft\n\nUser Request:\n\n[Insert User Description Here]", "", 0.6, 42, "fixed"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "image1", "label": "image1", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image1"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image2", "label": "image2", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image2"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image3", "label": "image3", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image3"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image4", "label": "image4", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image4"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "video", "label": "video", "type": "VIDEO", "localized_name": "video"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "role"}, "name": "role", "label": "role", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "role"}, {"widget": {"name": "prompt"}, "name": "prompt", "link": 14, "label": "prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}], "flags": {}, "id": 5, "type": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "RH_LLMAPI_Pro_Node"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "response", "links": [7, 18], "label": "response", "type": "STRING"